EML10047,CUS0167,Detailed Feedback regarding App Issues - BiryaniBox Mumbai,"Frequent app glitches and login errors! My saved addresses and loyalty points vanished after the latest app update. Customer support chat feature within the app loops endlessly without connecting to an agent. Unusable mobile application! Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Mumbai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",Critical,2024-02-07,Customer Email
