EML10049,CUS0169,Detailed Feedback regarding Payment - BiryaniBox Guntur,"Frustrating payment failure on the app! Money was debited twice from my bank account via UPI, but the app displayed an 'Order Failed' screen. Customer support phone lines were busy and chat bot provided zero assistance. It took 6 days of continuous follow-ups to get my hard-earned money refunded. Unreliable payment infrastructure!",Critical,2024-05-10,Customer Email
