EML10054,CUS0174,Detailed Feedback regarding Packaging - BiryaniBox Pune,"Top marks for packaging! The food arrived piping hot thanks to the insulated container design used by BiryaniBox Pune. Even during a long transit across Pune, there was zero leakage of gravy or oil. Cutlery, napkins, and mouth fresheners were neatly tucked into a separate pocket inside the delivery bag. Thoughtful packaging that enhances the overall meal experience.",Critical,2024-06-29,Customer Email
